we ought treat it as a\nstate fashioned plan</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1974 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Serfass v. United States</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/582315f5-f58f-4df5-a5d9-5e79426ac369.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1974 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>White, Secretary of State of Texas, et al. v. Regester et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/60c435b5-aa99-4b52-b54d-c1d42e168659.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>The Chief Justice 4 prong test\n(1) access (2) racist campaigning\n(4) consistent lack of success\n\nThought (1) was ques to be de-\ncided. (2) Thought 1st amend\nallowed this - how can it be a\nfactor in this (3) Indifference\nor apathy of elected representa-\ntive toward their constituents\n(4) lack of success standard\n\nStewart, J. No juris of this appeal\nunder Moody v Flowers &amp;\nnew Act\n\nWhite, J. If got merits would\naffirm except as to\nLubbock, Nueces, El Paso\n&amp; Travis not at rest</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1974 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Johnson et al. v. Mississippi et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/d5834197-a5cb-4af7-8d4c-e3b5fedd7dc2.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1974 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Johnson v. Railway Express Agency, Inc., et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/0d91e47e-f50d-4afe-9cf9-6c25a099ccc0.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1974 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Lefkowitz, Attorney General of New York v. Newsome</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span cla